{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseInvoices\">Purchase Invoices</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Create Invoice Invoices Is On Pending PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices RecurringPurchaseInvoice RecurringPurchaseInvoices Settings To ToDate\">The <strong>Pending Recurring Purchase Invoices</strong> screen displays purchase invoices that are scheduled to be created automatically based on their <em>recurring settings</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Invoice Invoices Is PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices Rate Supplier To ToDate View\">Use this screen to review upcoming purchase invoices before they are generated. You can see when each invoice is due, which supplier it is for, and the expected amount.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Create Date Delete Invoice Invoices Less On PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices To ToDate Transaction\">Purchase invoices shown here will be created automatically on their scheduled dates unless you modify or delete the <em>recurring transaction</em>.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Date Invoice Is PurchaseInvoice Rate RecurringPurchaseInvoice To ToDate\">Displays the scheduled date when this <em>recurring purchase invoice</em> will be automatically generated in the system.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Is Name PurchaseInvoice RecurringPurchaseInvoice Supplier\">Displays the supplier associated with each <em>recurring purchase invoice</em>. The supplier name will appear as shown in your supplier list.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description Invoice Is On PurchaseInvoice RecurringPurchaseInvoice Reference\">Shows the description or reference information for each <em>recurring purchase invoice</em>. This helps you identify the purpose of each scheduled invoice.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Create Currency Invoice Is PurchaseInvoice RecurringPurchaseInvoice To ToDate Total\">Displays the total amount of each <em>recurring purchase invoice</em> in its designated currency. This is the amount that will be recorded when the invoice is created.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-recurring-purchase-invoices"
}
